5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Let's find the werewolf quickly! I'm ready to help everyone!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,It is a grave situation. We must remain calm and observe each other carefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,...I'll do my best. I hope we can all get along.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let's not be too frightened. We shall find the truth together with kindness.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue-san. Let's keep a harmonious atmosphere while we figure this out.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're being so quiet! Are you hiding something?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"I am simply observing, Rin. Haste often leads to mistakes in these matters.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Hehe, Rin is always so energetic. It's quite refreshing, isn't it?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,It is. But George-san is right; we should be careful not to jump to conclusions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I just want to be the one to catch the bad guy!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"Your enthusiasm is noted, but let us see how everyone behaves tomorrow.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,...I'm a bit nervous.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"There is no need to be nervous, Daisuke-kun. We are all here for you.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"We'll support you, Daisuke-kun. Just speak your mind when you feel ready.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
