31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anyone have any scary dreams?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"I slept well. Now, we must consider who among us seems the most suspicious.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...I don't really know. Everyone seems normal to me.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I'm afraid I have some very sad news to share with you all.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What is it, Shizue-san? You look very serious.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What's wrong, Shizue-san? Tell us!","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"Please, Shizue-san, tell us what you have discovered.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,...Is something bad happening?,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I have seen the truth. George-san, I am so sorry, but you are the werewolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh my! Shizue-san is the Seer! George-san, is this true?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I knew it! I knew George was being too quiet!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"This is preposterous. Shizue-san, why would you lie to us in such a gentle way?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"...If Shizue-san says so, it must be true. She's always honest.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I truly wish it were a mistake, George-san, but my vision was very clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"It's heartbreaking, but we have to trust the Seer to protect the village.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,Let's vote for George! Let's do it now!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"You are all being led by a lie. I am a human, just like you.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll vote for George-san. I'm sorry.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I believe this is the only way to ensure our peace.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree. I'm sorry, George-san, but we must vote.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
